        {"title": "Замена", "text": "$t = 2-3e^x$, $dt = -3e^x dx$, $e^x dx = -\\frac{dt}{3}$:", "math": "$$\\int e^x\\sqrt{2-3e^x}\\,dx = -\\frac{1}{3}\\int t^{1/2}\\,dt$$"},
        {"title": "Интегрирование и ответ", "math": "$$-\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}\\,t^{3/2} = -\\frac{2}{9}(2-3e^x)^{3/2} + C$$"},
