        {"title": "Шаг 2: По частям", "text": "$u = t$, $dv = e^t dt$ → $du = dt$, $v = e^t$:", "math": "$$2\\int t\\,e^t\\,dt = 2\\left(te^t - \\int e^t\\,dt\\right) = 2(te^t - e^t) = 2e^t(t-1)$$"},
        {"title": "Ответ", "text": "Обратная замена $t = \\sqrt{x}$:", "math": "$$\\boxed{2e^{\\sqrt{x}}(\\sqrt{x}-1) + C}$$"}
