        {"title": "Шаг 2: Первый → корень", "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{(4x+8)\\,dx}{\\sqrt{2x^2+8x+6}} = \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\sqrt{2x^2+8x+6} = \\sqrt{2x^2+8x+6}$"},
        {"title": "Шаг 3: Второй → логарифм", "text": "$2x^2+8x+6 = 2(x^2+4x+3) = 2((x+2)^2-1)$.\n$$-\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{2((x+2)^2-1)}} = -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\ln|x+2+\\sqrt{(x+2)^2-1}|$$"},
        {"title": "Ответ", "math": "$$\\boxed{\\sqrt{2x^2+8x+6} - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\ln|x+2+\\sqrt{(x+2)^2-1}| + C}$$"}
